@Transactional
public AllocationView registerAtSite(String experimentId, String siteCode, String participantId, String assignmentKey, String actorId) {
    validate participantId, assignmentKey (400)
    ExperimentRow experiment = experimentRepository.lockById(experimentId);
    if (experiment == null) throw notFound;
    if ("CLOSED".equals(experiment.status())) throw conflict("实验已关闭，拒绝新增分配");
    SiteRow site = siteRepository.lockById(experimentId, siteCode);
    if (site == null) throw notFound("中心不存在: " + siteCode);
    // assignmentKey 业务键重放：同键同人同受试者 → 返回首次结果；异参 → 409
    AllocationRow byKey = allocationRepository.findByAssignmentKey(assignmentKey);
    if (byKey != null) {
        if (byKey.experimentId().equals(experimentId) && siteCode.equals(byKey.siteCode())
                && byKey.participantId().equals(participantId) && byKey.assignedActor().equals(actorId)) {
            return toView(byKey);
        }
        throw conflict("assignmentKey 已绑定其他受试者或操作者");
    }
    if (!"ACTIVE".equals(site.status())) {
        throw conflict("中心未处于激活状态，拒绝生成盲码与分配区组: " + gateReasonText);
    }
    AllocationRow existing = findByExperimentAndParticipant(...);
    if (existing != null) throw conflict("参与者已在该实验登记，仅可占一席");
    long allocated = allocationRepository.countBySite(experimentId, siteCode);
    if (allocated >= site.targetCap()) throw full("中心累计分配已达目标入组上限");
    VacantSeat vacant = takeFirstVacantSeat; null → full("实验席位已满");
    insert with site fields (site_generation = site.generation(), assignment_key)
}
```

Gate message for non-active: use status-specific message: PENDING → "中心未激活", SUSPENDED → "中心已暂停", CLOSED → "中心已关闭". 409 in all cases per spec （未激活 → 409; 暂停不接受新分配 → 409; 关闭 → 409).

insertWithUniqueBlindCode needs variant with site fields. I'll generalize the existing private method to accept siteCode/generation/assignmentKey (null for old path).

DuplicateKey on assignment key concurrent → 409 "assignmentKey 已被使用".

